\u002F\u002Fdemo.fivenet.app\u002F",[233,234,237],"callout",{"icon":235,"color":236},"i-mdi-warning-circle","warning",[219,238,239,240,244],{},"The demo instance resets every ",[241,242,243],"strong",{},"12 hours",". During the reset, it may be unavailable for a few seconds, and some data may be cleared.",[246,247,249],"h2",{"id":248},"login","Login",[219,251,252],{},"Use the following credentials:",[254,255,261],"pre",{"className":256,"code":258,"language":259,"meta":260},[257],"language-text","Username: demo\nPassword: fivenet-demo\n","text","",[262,263,258],"code",{"__ignoreMap":260},[233,265,267],{"icon":266},"i-mdi-info-slab-circle",[219,268,269],{},"Not every feature is fully available in the demo environment. Some advanced functionality may be limited or simulated.",[246,271,273],{"id":272},"best-way-to-explore","Best Way to Explore",[219,275,276,277,280,281,284],{},"The demo account includes multiple characters. For the best overview, use the ",[241,278,279],{},"Los Santos Police Department (LSPD)"," character with the ",[262,282,283],{},"police"," job.",[219,286,287,288,291],{},"This character has access to ",[241,289,290],{},"superuser mode",", which lets you:",[293,294,295,299],"ul",{},[296,297,298],"li",{},"Switch between jobs",[296,300,301],{},"Explore administrative features",[219,303,304,305,308],{},"You can enable or disable superuser mode from the ",[241,306,307],{},"user menu"," in the left sidebar.",[233,310,313],{"icon":311,"color":312},"i-mdi-lightbulb-on-outline","info",[219,314,315],{},"If you want to explore as much of FiveNet as possible, start with the police character and enable superuser mode.",[246,317,319],{"id":318},"feedback","Feedback",[219,321,322],{},"If you run into problems or have suggestions, reach out to the FiveNet team on Discord.",{"title":260,"searchDepth":324,"depth":324,"links":325},2,[326,327,328],{"id":248,"depth":324,"text":249},{"id":272,"depth":324,"text":273},{"id":318,"depth":324,"text":319},"Try FiveNet using the